  m=13: heavy class and single elements at every prime of n=15015: bad share 627/4096   B=[0, 1, 2, 3, 10014, 5010, 9015, 13020, 6300, 14595, 7875, 1155, 8085]
  m=6 on Z_75: bad share 11/32   B=[0, 0, 25, 25, 38, 50]
